| cap | a3 − LRU Δhit [95% CI] | a3 − PIN Δhit [95% CI] | a3 − LRU Δrecomp [CI] | a3 − PIN Δrecomp [CI] |
|----:|------------------------|------------------------|----------------------:|----------------------:|
