struct StoredData {
    parentHash: optional&lt;id&gt; // The parent of the sequence of blocks that was stored.
    blocks: list&lt;StoredBlockData&gt; // The list of stored blocks
}

struct RemovedData {
    blockHashes: list&lt;id&gt; // The hashes of b
---
or updated, an event is emitted. These events can be consumed in real time by an application to get an eventually consistent view of the current state of the TensorRT-LLM KV cache. This is especially useful for tracking KV cache reuse opportunities. It can be used on the scale of a single executor to anticipate which requests will have more reuse, or aggregated across many executors to make KV-aware routing and scheduling decisions (Figure 2).</p>


